  "crew": [
    {
      "name": "Vladimir Korosec",
      "avatar": "/media/media::image::a::vessel::66ff2540-6a06-11ef-a627-0fab1205a487::assets::ce2e5280-0ee4-11f0-9df2-55d2478d2239/{imageVariant}",
      "role": "Captain",
      "bio": "Nationality: Croatian\n\nCaptain Vladimir has a real passion for the sea and his career spans over 15 years of work in the yachting industry. Vladimir was captain on various motor yachts such as Sanlorenzo, Dominator, Princess, Ferretti, Azimut, Maiora and many others. Before he took over the yachting line as the captain, Vladimir was strongly linked to sport, being professional basketball player and Head coach and young players instructor. He grew up in Pula, seaside town on the Istrian peninsula, and passion for the sea was always an inspiration and personal calling. Vladimir says that it links his crew team dynamic to that of a sport team player working together to reach the high score - to wow the guests. Coming to a new SL96 PRIMUS, Vladimir will continue to demonstrate his sincere commitment, passion and leadership skill. His voyages on MY PRIMUS have only been a continuation of a beautiful professional and human story."
    },
    {
      "name": "Kristijan Milanovic",
      "avatar": "/media/media::image::a::vessel::66ff2540-6a06-11ef-a627-0fab1205a487::assets::0adcaf60-0ee5-11f0-9f5d-c98fb411bf73/{imageVariant}",
      "role": "Captain",
      "bio": "Nationality: Croatian\n\nOriginally from the coastal city of Pula, Croatia, Chef Kristijan brings over 12 years of experience from the dynamic and thriving Croatian restaurant scene. This talented Chef is creating his own menus and recipes, he is enthusiast in growing organic food and Kristijan's main cooking passion is the interpretation of the Mediterranean food.\n\nHaving previously worked aboard another Sanlorenzo yacht for the past three years, Kristijan earned high praise from discerning guests for his talent, professionalism, and ability to elevate every dining experience. Proficient in English, he effortlessly communicates and caters to an international clientele, ensuring that each meal exceeds expectations.\n\nFor Kristijan, cooking is not just a profession but a way of life—his greatest hobby is his craft: creating and savoring good food. Whether delighting guests with beautifully presented dishes or sharing his knowledge of Mediterranean flavors, Chef Kristijan’s passion shines through, promising a truly memorable onboard culinary journey."
    },
    {
      "name": "Mary Jian Morie",
      "avatar": "/media/media::image::a::vessel::66ff2540-6a06-11ef-a627-0fab1205a487::assets::2f6ba9d0-0ee5-11f0-a01c-7983dbf02c18/{imageVariant}",
      "role": "Captain",
      "bio": "Nationality: Filipino\n\nMary Jian brings a wealth of experience from her previous roles onboard luxury yachts, where she honed her exceptional service skills. With a natural ability to create a relaxed and positive atmosphere, Mary ensures that guests feel comfortable and well cared for throughout their time onboard.\n\nHer enthusiasm for yachting and strong communication skills make her an invaluable part of the crew on MY PRIMUS. Always professional and attentive, Mary is dedicated to maintaining the highest standards of hospitality while seamlessly contributing to the smooth operation of the yacht."
    },
    {
      "name": "Jay-ar Caballes",
      "role": "Captain",
      "bio": "Nationality: Filipino\n\nJay-ar is a hardworking and dedicated deckhand from the Philippines, born by the sea with a lifelong passion for fishing and sailing. His background in hospitality allows him to provide exceptional guest service while maintaining a positive and professional attitude onboard. Skilled in yacht maintenance, line handling, and water sports operations, he is always eager to contribute to the team. With a proactive attitude and a willingness to learn, Jay-ar adapts well to dynamic environments and takes on new challenges with enthusiasm."
    },
